            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Hatred of Red"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Pairakas hate the color red. They won't wear the color or willingly enter any place painted red. Given a choice, they'll attack a creature wearing red first. If barred from expressing their displeasure toward the color by force or some magical effect, they take 2d6 mental damage at the end of their turn."
            },
